WEBVTT

00:12:28.060 --> 00:12:31.278
I'm taking back a little bit of power
that was taken away from me.

00:12:31.302 --> 00:12:32.700
And I have changed the names,

00:12:32.724 --> 00:12:35.969
and it's been a decade,
so it's going to be OK.

00:12:35.993 --> 00:12:37.711
And it doesn't have a happy ending,

00:12:37.735 --> 00:12:41.026
because it's just me writing down
what happened that day.

00:12:41.708 --> 00:12:45.236
And so this is how I use creative writing

00:12:45.950 --> 00:12:47.514
to bear witness.

00:12:51.174 --> 00:12:53.005
At Lisa's going-away luncheon,

00:12:54.838 --> 00:12:57.286
I wanted to ask my boss's boss's boss

00:12:57.310 --> 00:12:58.799
if he's stupid

00:12:58.823 --> 00:13:00.472
or just plain dumb